    "title": "Minnesota Avenue Mayhem: KCK Arrest Leaves Window Smashed And Questions Flying - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Clara Lin ,\n5 hours ago Midday traffic on Minnesota Avenue turned into a street-side spectacle Sunday when an arrest in downtown Kansas City, Kansas, spiraled into chaos. Two men were taken into custody, a dress shop window exploded into shards during a struggle, and one injured man left the block in an ambulance. Security footage shows a pickup rolling into a parked car as bystanders insisted the arresting officers were federal agents, although no agency has stepped forward to confirm who was involved. Read full article\n2",
